    "title": "County officials hopes to call further attention to littering problem in South Bend - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Leo Goldman ,\n5 hours ago ST. JOSEPH COUNTY, Ind. -- One St. Joseph County official is trying to further curb littering in the area near Portage Manor. Derek Dieter is the St. Joseph County surveyor and is once again doing an event to try and bring awareness to how bad the local littering problem has become. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
